Mouse Wheelie for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Mouse Wheelie 1.16.3 by Siphalor.
Original source: https://github.com/Siphalor/mouse-wheelie
Original licence: Apache-2.0

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API
(no Java code is included, no [[native.mixin]] rows). This port is distributed under the same
licence as the original (Apache-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE.
